### On completion (orchestrator waits on these paths only)
Parent polls **only** `{SIGNAL_DIR}/debug_module.{MODULE_KEY}.done` or `{SIGNAL_DIR}/debug_module.{MODULE_KEY}.fail`.

- **Do not** create `{OMNI_PATH}/.done`, repo-root `touch .done`, or any `.done`/`.fail` under `{OMNI_PATH}` — **ignored**; run hangs until timeout.
- **Success:** create exactly:
  - Path: `{SIGNAL_DIR}/debug_module.{MODULE_KEY}.done`
  - Content: `DEBUG_MODULE_DONE {MODULE_NAME}`
  - Example: `printf '%s\n' 'DEBUG_MODULE_DONE {MODULE_NAME}' > '{SIGNAL_DIR}/debug_module.{MODULE_KEY}.done'`
- **Cannot fix:** `{SIGNAL_DIR}/debug_module.{MODULE_KEY}.fail` (plain text).
